; DEVELOPMENT TEMPLATE ONLY.
; Classic CANopen / CiA 301 binding target for a CiA 402-style drive.
; NOT CiA 1301 CANopen FD and not evidence of protocol conformance.
; Vendor/Product identifiers are intentionally unassigned placeholders.

